  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Global International Tax - Revenue Administration and Policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance will focus on improving audit capacity on international issues, and assisting in implementation of standards and measures stemming from OECDs Base Erosion and Profit Shifting (BEPS) initiative and automatic exchange of information (AEOI). The emphasis will be on engagements narrowly focused on international issues, as opposed to larger projects of which international issues would be one part. The list of countries participating in the project is still being developed.</narrative>
  </description>
